  "scope": "Actual original-forest and keyed-draw inputs construct each candidate record in an ordered bank. The same literal returned bank feeds the existing changing-selected-state controller. Exact typed old selection is returned on that actual run. The bound uses only original forest edge-list sizes, original bank draw counts and cells, initial seed/Q sizes, and candidate count; it does not take generated host/catalogue/bank sizes as premises. Raw rational-atom arithmetic, source forest/draw representations, original assignment correspondence, seed/forest construction, random generation, fuel evaluation and physical bit complexity remain explicit.",
